sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant Tauri as Tauri (Rust)
    participant BE as Backend (Python)
    participant DB as MySQL

    Note over BE,DB: Workflow Start
    BE->>DB: create WorkflowExecution
    BE->>DB: create CoordinatorPlan
    BE->>DB: create_session(wf_exec) → session_id
    BE->>DB: session_status = "running"
    BE->>DB: emit workflow.session.started (event_seq=1)

    Note over BE,DB: Step Dispatch
    BE->>DB: create Execution (pending_local)
    BE->>DB: emit step.planned (event_seq=2)

    Note over Tauri: Worker claims execution
    Tauri->>BE: GET /bundle
    BE-->>Tauri: execution_kind + payload

    alt execution_kind = http_provider
        Tauri->>Tauri: sidecar LLM call
    else execution_kind = external_cli
        Tauri->>Tauri: lookup adapter in registry

        alt approval_policy = ask_before_shell
            Tauri->>FE: emit external_cli:approval_requested
            Note over FE: SweetAlert modal<br/>(adapter / cwd / prompt preview)
            FE->>Tauri: submit_workflow_approval_response<br/>(decision=granted)
            Tauri->>Tauri: resolve oneshot → runner proceeds
            Tauri->>BE: POST .../approvals/{id}/respond
            BE->>DB: create_and_resolve_approval(granted)
            BE->>DB: approval.requested + approval.granted events
            BE->>DB: session_status running → waiting_approval → running
        end

        Tauri->>Tauri: spawn CLI (claude/codex/generic)
        Note over Tauri: stream stdout/stderr<br/>file change detection
    end

    Tauri->>BE: POST /complete (output + meta)
    BE->>DB: finalize_execution (output, status)
    BE->>DB: bind_runtime(step, adapter/runtime)
    BE->>DB: emit step.completed (event_seq=N)
    BE->>DB: emit runtime.selected (event_seq=N+1)
    BE->>DB: record CoordinatorArtifact
    BE->>DB: add_artifact_ref(step, artifact_id)
    BE->>DB: emit artifact.created (event_seq=N+2)

    Note over BE,DB: Workflow Complete
    BE->>DB: session_status = "completed"
    BE->>DB: emit workflow.session.completed
